1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:37,318
{\an8}AI narration | Actual app | Recorded Codex repair | 1.35x playback

2
00:00:00,518 --> 00:00:03,491
Statebound checks trading workflows before execution.

3
00:00:03,491 --> 00:00:07,977
This is a synthetic fixture, with a twenty USDT spending mandate and zero fees.

4
00:00:07,977 --> 00:00:10,501
The example plan is deliberately vulnerable.

5
00:00:10,501 --> 00:00:12,016
No real orders are placed.

6
00:00:15,037 --> 00:00:17,319
Find a failure runs a fresh bounded search.

7
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:21,671
The checker finds a path that spends thirty USDT against the twenty USDT mandate.

8
00:00:21,671 --> 00:00:24,272
These events come from the plan and fault model.

9
00:00:24,778 --> 00:00:27,617
The first order filled, but its reply was lost.

10
00:00:27,617 --> 00:00:29,188
The agent sees a timeout.

11
00:00:29,188 --> 00:00:31,484
A stale balance cannot prove failure.

12
00:00:31,484 --> 00:00:35,713
Fifteen USDT remains exposed, so a fresh purchase is not free budget.

13
00:00:39,222 --> 00:00:42,573
This is a recorded repair authored by the development Codex session.

14
00:00:42,573 --> 00:00:45,826
It queries the original attempt before buying the remaining goal.

15
00:00:45,826 --> 00:00:48,142
We validate that candidate and recheck it now.

16
00:00:48,142 --> 00:00:49,571
The mandate stays unchanged.

17
00:00:54,522 --> 00:00:58,939
The recoverable replay runs through the shared interpreter and a persistent SQLite ledger.

18
00:00:58,939 --> 00:01:02,472
When the order query confirms the fill, the acquisition goal completes.

19
00:01:02,472 --> 00:01:05,024
The original ambiguous attempt is never sent again.

20
00:01:11,101 --> 00:01:12,822
Now the lookup stays inconclusive.

21
00:01:12,822 --> 00:01:15,959
Statebound finishes unresolved and preserves the reservation.

22
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:20,766
No violation within a finite bound does not mean the environment must let every task complete.

23
00:01:23,021 --> 00:01:28,296
The integration panel shows a genuine recorded public testnet read through the official Binance CLI.

24
00:01:28,296 --> 00:01:29,826
Trading remains unavailable.

25
00:01:29,826 --> 00:01:33,518
Exported evidence includes the plan, bounds, observations and replay.

26
00:01:33,518 --> 00:01:36,577
A separate verifier recomputes the result without an LLM.
